# Effective ignore for `docker build -f mayhem/Dockerfile` (BuildKit prefers this over a root .dockerignore).
# .git is deliberately NOT excluded: the image carries the full history of the `mayhem` branch.
# Only untracked build products and run scratch are pruned; every tracked file stays, so the image's
# tree is exactly the checkout.
**/*.o
**/*.obj
**/*.exe
/stb_c_lexer_fuzzer
/stb_c_lexer_fuzzer-standalone
/stb_png_read_fuzzer
/stb_png_read_fuzzer-standalone
/stbi_read_fuzzer
/stbi_read_fuzzer-standalone
/stb_png_regress_check
/stb_ds_unit_tests
/ctrf-report.json
/.crashers
/.inputs
